<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="An unofficial one-level version of SuperTux, played in the browser, with the original enemies or with enemies trained by reinforcement learning.">
  <link rel="icon" href="supertux2.ico?v=@SUPERTUX_VERSION_STRING@">
  <title>SuperTux: Shallow Green</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --text: #f2f4fa;
      --muted: #a9b0c4;
      --faint: #7f879c;
      --card: #10142acc;
      --card-edge: #ffffff1f;
      --classic: #e9eef8;
      --classic-text: #141a33;
      --trained: #ffcc4d;
      --trained-text: #2a1c00;
      --link: #8cf;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html,
    body {
      height: 100%;
      margin: 0;
    }

    body {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      color: var(--text);
      font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0b0e1e;
      background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000a, #000c), url("supertux2_bkg.png?v=@SUPERTUX_VERSION_STRING@");
      animation: scroll 10s linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes scroll {
      from { background-position: 0 0, 0 0; }
      to { background-position: 0 0, -256px 0; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      body { animation: none; }
    }

    main {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 32px 16px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      image-rendering: auto;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      font-size: 40px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .level {
      margin: 4px 0 28px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .modes {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 260px));
      gap: 16px;
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .mode {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--card-edge);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--card);
    }

    .mode h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .tag {
      margin-left: 4px;
      padding: 1px 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--card-edge);
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 400;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    .mode p {
      flex: 1;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .start {
      display: block;
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.1s, filter 0.1s;
    }

    .start:hover,
    .start:focus-visible {
      filter: brightness(1.08);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .start:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--link);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .classic .start {
      background: var(--classic);
      color: var(--classic-text);
    }

    .trained .start {
      background: var(--trained);
      color: var(--trained-text);
    }

    .hint {
      margin: 24px 0 0;
      color: var(--faint);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    kbd {
      padding: 0 5px;
      border: 1px solid #ffffff33;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font: inherit;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 12px 16px 16px;
      color: var(--faint);
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    footer p {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 2px auto;
    }

    footer a {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .modes {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 320px);
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main>
    <img class="logo" src="supertux2.png?v=@SUPERTUX_VERSION_STRING@" alt="">
    <h1>SuperTux</h1>
    <p class="level">Shallow Green</p>

    <div class="modes">
      <section class="mode classic">
        <h2>Classic</h2>
        <p>The level as it was made, with the original enemies.</p>
        <a class="start" href="play.html?ai=off">START</a>
      </section>
      <section class="mode trained">
        <h2>Trained AI <span class="tag">self-play</span></h2>
        <p>These enemies learned from hundreds of hours of simulated play against a Tux that kept learning too.
          Each one sees where it is in the level, how you move and what its allies are doing, and picks its tactic:
          it waits for you, cuts you off, flanks you or backs off from your stomps.</p>
        <a class="start" href="play.html?ai=coevo4">START</a>
      </section>
    </div>

    <p class="hint"><kbd>&larr;</kbd> <kbd>&rarr;</kbd> move, <kbd>Space</kbd> jump, <kbd>Esc</kbd> menu. The first start downloads about 340&nbsp;MB; later starts load it from your browser.</p>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>SuperTux &copy; 2003&ndash;2026 SuperTux Devel Team. This is an unofficial version, modified in 2026 by ponyo877
      (one level, enemies trained by reinforcement learning). It comes with ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY. It is free software, and you
      are welcome to redistribute it under the GNU General Public License version 3:
      <a href="LICENSE.txt">license</a>, <a href="https://github.com/ponyo877/typesafe-supertux">source code</a>.</p>
    <p>Level &ldquo;Shallow Green&rdquo; by Carsten Wirtz and music &ldquo;Forest Midday&rdquo; by SnugglyBun and Marek Moeckel, both
      <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>. The enemies&rsquo; first tactics were
      labeled by Claude (Anthropic), then learned by playing; earlier modes used answers precomputed with Laya by
      Convai Innovations (Apache 2.0). <a href="credits.html">Full credits and licenses</a>.</p>
  </footer>
</body>

</html>
